Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:23:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IMPORTS-3: recording a row as a transfer retires a deleted
 twin's identity

approveStaged suffixes a deleted transaction's source_id before a new one
takes it; approveStagedAsTransfer did not. Approve, delete, re-import,
record as a transfer, then restore the deleted one: the restore hit the
unique index, a 500. Both paths now share retireDeletedTwin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
